# Diagonal hazard stripes for the arena boundary. Tiles both ways.
#
# 45 degrees at a 4px pitch, which is the one pattern that means "do not cross"
# without a word of text. rust-* rather than alarm-*: the wall is permanent
# scenery, and alarm red is reserved for things that are about to hurt you.
name shooter-hazard
size 16 16
key R rust-2
key K tar-0-pit
pixels
RRRRKKKKRRRRKKKK
RRRKKKKRRRRKKKKR
RRKKKKRRRRKKKKRR
RKKKKRRRRKKKKRRR
KKKKRRRRKKKKRRRR
KKKRRRRKKKKRRRRK
KKRRRRKKKKRRRRKK
KRRRRKKKKRRRRKKK
RRRRKKKKRRRRKKKK
RRRKKKKRRRRKKKKR
RRKKKKRRRRKKKKRR
RKKKKRRRRKKKKRRR
KKKKRRRRKKKKRRRR
KKKRRRRKKKKRRRRK
KKRRRRKKKKRRRRKK
KRRRRKKKKRRRRKKK
